{"schema_version":"2.0.0","record_type":"user_anchored_interaction","event_id":"codex:codex-retro-daily-audit:H002","record_revision":1,"provider":"codex","version_ids":["v0","v1","v2","v3","v4"],"session":{"session_id":"codex-retro-daily-audit","role":"retrospective","parent_session_id":null,"depth":0,"agent_role":null},"sequence":2,"classification":{"source_record_class":"human_user_message","authorship":"human","human_input_eligible":true,"classification_notes":"Codex 顶层 retrospective session 中的直接人类输入；version_ids 表示后验审计覆盖范围，不代表各版本当时执行了该输入。"},"event_type":"instruction","thread_ids":["retrospective-audit","audit-gates","subagent-orchestration"],"user":{"verbatim":"PLEASE IMPLEMENT THIS PLAN:\n# Codex/Claude 开发时间线审计计划\n\n## Summary\n\n在 `<workspace>/docs/audti/260611` 建立一个文件化审计包（audit package），由 sub-agent 串行执行：\n\n1. 先生成证据目录（source inventory）和日期队列（day queue）。\n2. 每一天由一个梳理 worker 产出每日文档。\n3. 每日文档必须经过独立审计 worker 审计通过。\n4. 主控 agent 只做调度、验收、返修决策，不亲自生产正文。\n5. 所有已通过每日文档再合并成总线路报告（total timeline）。\n\n默认日期范围：从本项目可证据化的开发起点到最后一次项目实质开发记录。初始候选为 `2026-05-21` 到 `2026-06-08`；`2026-06-09` 到 `2026-06-11` 只在证据目录确认有项目实质开发时纳入，不把当前审计筹备本身混入历史线路。\n\n## Key Changes\n\n- 目标目录按用户原文使用 `docs/audti/260611`，不改成 `audit`。\n- 在目标目录下创建：\n  - `README.md`：本审计包说明。\n  - `source_inventory.md`：Claude/Codex transcript、loop artifacts、git、user-insights 的证据索引。\n  - `day_queue.md`：每日处理状态。\n  - `daily/`：通过审计的每日梳理文档。\n  - `audits/`：每日独立审计报告。\n  - `repairs/`：返修记录。\n  - `decisions/`：主控验收记录。\n  - `final/total_timeline.md`：最终总线路。\n- 主要证据源按优先级读取：\n  - `~/.claude/projects/<workspace-key>/**/*.jsonl`\n  - `~/.codex/sessions/**` 与 `~/.codex/archived_sessions/**`\n  - `user-insights/**`\n  - `loops/v0*`、`loops/v1*`、`loops/v2*`、`loops/v3*`、`loops/v4*`\n  - `git log --date=iso --name-status`\n  - `docs/` 仅作为二次对照，不作为唯一事实源。\n\n## Workflow\n\n- `inventory worker`：只读扫描所有证据源，生成按日期分组的 source inventory 和 day queue。\n- `daily synthesis worker`：一次只处理一天，产出中文每日梳理，术语用「中文（English）」锚定；必须包含时间线、关键决策、实现变化、问题/坑、方案、证据地图、未解决问题。\n- `independent audit worker`：不继承梳理 worker 上下文，只从每日文档和证据源审计，输出 `pass | revise | block`。\n- `repair worker`：只处理审计列出的 required changes，返修后必须重新审计。\n- `main agent`：只有在审计 `pass` 后写主控验收记录，才允许进入下一天。\n- `final synthesis worker`：只合并已通过每日文档和验收记录，生成总线路报告。\n\n## Gate Policy\n\n每日进入下一天必须满足：\n\n- `daily/YYYYMMDD_*.md` 存在。\n- `audits/YYYYMMDD_*.md` 明确 `audit_result: pass`。\n- 每个关键结论都有证据路径或 transcript 定位。\n- 没有跨日污染、无证据推断、或把 memory/summary 当唯一事实源。\n- `decisions/YYYYMMDD_acceptance.md` 由主控写明通过原因和残余风险。\n\n阻断条件：\n\n- 证据冲突无法自解。\n- Claude/Codex transcript 覆盖不足以支持当天结论。\n- 审计要求返修两轮后仍不能通过。\n- 需要用户判断某个高影响归因或范围边界。\n\n## Test Plan\n\n- 对每日日报做三角校验（triangulation）：至少尝试用 `transcript + loop artifact + git/user-insights` 中的两类证据支撑关键结论。\n- 审计抽查所有 claim_id，标注 `supported / weak / unsupported`。\n- 最终总线路只读取已通过日报、独立审计、主控验收，不直接从未审计 transcript 生成新结论。\n- 完成后运行只读检查：确认目标目录文件完整、日期队列全通过或明确阻断、没有写入目标目录外的项目文件。\n\n## Assumptions\n\n- 主语言为中文，技术术语采用「中文（English）」锚定。\n- 所有具体梳理、审计、返修、最终合并都交给 sub-agent；主控不替代 worker 写正文。\n- 当前未跟踪文件不处理、不回滚、不纳入本次修改范围，除非它们已作为历史证据被明确引用。\n","format":"markdown","sha256":"sha256:e2c88c5639d5c11e793a1c45bdef7fa704d1933d31b5815d994ac93ef497f68c","source_message_ordinal":2},"assistant":{"status":"summarized","summary":"助手进入执行态，启动证据目录 worker，确认主线日期为 2026-05-21 至 2026-06-08、排除 6 月 9 日至 11 日的当前审计活动，并开始 5 月 21 日的日报生产与门禁流程。","summary_mode":"not_verbatim","core_insights":[],"actions":[],"observed_effects":[],"source_message_ids":["sha256:b5928528531df17300e37c8dc8df9fe654b920c59f811774bd998cdda808f56b","sha256:de90c574a579b8d5cd2b23d46aa3f645660992e93d537b50e5e45968d68c2579","sha256:aba0b960076a4739ac11f7b707a9c5b1e9c4bc3afb3a02cefcc8b0d22594bd71","sha256:ee75135d4890ac2e8f8e671ebfd17be63321ac6f27a651b9f428c0bb37984184","sha256:dc3b186f5d6943133b5f39d82df86d475bb1fad38458e42f0469864791e83ced"],"summary_provenance":{"method":"model_generated","review_status":"reviewed","summary_revision":1,"notes":"仅概括该用户输入后、下一条用户输入前的用户可见助手核心输出；不复述原回复。"}},"times":{"source_recorded_at":"2026-06-11T08:45:05.770Z","file_declared_at":null,"file_mtime_observed_at":null,"git_author_at":null,"git_commit_at":null,"ingested_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00+08:00"},"artifacts":[{"artifact_id":"retrospective-audit-package","type":"other","ref":"<workspace>/docs/audti/260611","relation":"declared","evidence_basis":"transcript"}],"provenance":{"source_id":"codex-retro-daily-audit","source_message_id":"line:125","source_record_sha256":"sha256:d07f444c4c73c4bdb76d1b647bfa12b58d46f2ea94cd60f0cdaf9e9dfb566cfd","assistant_window_end":"2026-06-11T08:52:26.146Z","coverage":"full"},"privacy":{"sensitivity":"private","retention":"local_redacted","publication":"redacted","review_status":"reviewed","reviewed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"codex-retrospective-privacy-review","redactions":[{"category":"absolute_path","replacement":"<workspace>/...","reason":"移除本机用户名和绝对工作区路径。"},{"category":"path_embedded_identity","replacement":"~/.claude/projects/<workspace-key>/...","reason":"移除 Claude 项目目录键中编码的用户名和绝对路径。"}]},"generation":{"extractor_version":"v0.2.0","summary_prompt_version":"interaction-event-summary-v2","summary_model":"gpt-5.6","generated_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00+08:00"},"supersedes":null,"version_relations":[{"version_id":"v0","relation":"retrospective"},{"version_id":"v1","relation":"retrospective"},{"version_id":"v2","relation":"retrospective"},{"version_id":"v3","relation":"retrospective"},{"version_id":"v4","relation":"retrospective"}]}
